          "type": "text",
          "text": "A sprinkler supplies water uniformly to a field of area 1.5 hectares at 0.45 litres per second. Express the resulting water-depth rate in millimetres per hour. Use 1 hectare = 10,000 square metres and 1 litre over 1 square metre = 1 millimetre of depth."
        }
      ],
